    <mxCell id="report-tpl" value="# {Package} Build Analysis&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(MANDATORY)&lt;br&gt;## Executive summary&lt;br&gt;## Source Discovery&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(source-finder)&lt;br&gt;## Repository Layout&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(Step 2)&lt;br&gt;## Build System Analysis&lt;br&gt;## Compilation Requirements (complexity)&lt;br&gt;## Dependencies Analysis&lt;br&gt;## Environment Investigation (env-finder)&lt;br&gt;## Packaging Issue Analysis (bug-finder)&lt;br&gt;## CI/CD Analysis&lt;br&gt;## License Compatibility (license-checker)&lt;br&gt;## Security Assessment&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(security-audit)&lt;br&gt;## Documentation Review&lt;br&gt;## Recommendations" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;strokeWidth=1;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=5;align=left;spacingLeft=8;fontSize=10;fontFamily=JetBrains Mono,Courier New,monospace;arcSize=16;absoluteArcSize=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
